## Why she left

@vesper{code="0010"}: Every comet tonight is a star I let out. I opened his lantern. They fell. You're selling them.
@pim{code="0010" emotion="smug"}: Retail's retail.
<branch id="s2Answer" prompt="Vesper is waiting to see what you think of her.">
  <choice id="thank" label="Thank you for opening it.">
    @vesper{code="0020" emotion="sad"}: ...Nobody's thanked me. They mostly run.
  </choice>
  <choice id="late" label="Why did it take eleven years?">
    @vesper{code="0030" emotion="angry"}: Because I'm a coward who got brave late. Is that what you wanted?
    @vesper{code="0040" emotion="sad"}: Late still counts. I hope.
  </choice>
</branch>
@lumi{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: She's on the Wishing Well tonight. If you want her.
